  "description": {
    "en": "Luxilon Natural Gut is a premium natural gut string engineered with a unique protective coating and carefully selected organic raw materials to deliver exceptional feel, comfort, elasticity and long-term tension maintenance. Designed specifically to complement Luxilon monofilament strings in hybrid setups, it offers remarkable shock absorption, outstanding responsiveness and durability that exceeds most synthetic strings. Available in 1.20, 1.25 and 1.30 mm gauges, it allows players to choose between ultimate feel, balanced performance or increased durability.",

    "zh": "Luxilon Natural Gut 是 Luxilon 推出的高端天然肠线，采用天然有机原料与专属保护涂层制造，能够提供极佳的手感、舒适性、弹性以及长期保磅能力。官方特别强调其针对 Luxilon 聚酯球线混穿而设计，在保持天然肠线优秀击球反馈的同时，拥有出色的避震效果、响应速度以及超过绝大多数合成球线的耐打性。提供 1.20、1.25 与 1.30 三种线径，可分别满足极致手感、综合平衡及更高耐久性的不同需求。"
  },

